Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:44.98,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,"I'd like to meet you after class and talk."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:47.94,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,"And what are you calling me for?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:50.94,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Doesn't he know what day today is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:55.28,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Nothing serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:58.57,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I just got the urge to call, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:03.23,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm fine with meeting up,\Nbut can we do it early?
