Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:51.48,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Hey, Ayanokoji!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.81,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Did you get any chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.81,0:02:54.65,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:02:59.90,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Translation: he wants to know \Nif you got any from Horikita.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:02.82,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Idiot! It's got nothing to do with Suzune!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.45,0:03:05.45,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,So? You get any?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:07.95,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I haven't gotten any.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.95,0:03:09.66,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I don't expect to get any.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.41,0:03:12.79,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,You serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.79,0:03:13.75,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:16.63,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.63,0:03:18.81,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,She'd never give {\i1}you{\i0} any, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:24.59,Main,Sotomura,0,0,0,,Chocolate is nothing. \NI can do without it, myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.59,0:03:26.14,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Don't act tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:29.85,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Wait, Sotomura, what happened to \Nyour old-timey speech pattern?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:32.19,Main,Sotomura,0,0,0,,Oh, so you noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.55,0:03:36.40,Main,Sotomura,0,0,0,,Our recent meditation training \Nmade me realize my true self,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:38.52,Main,Sotomura,0,0,0,,so I left that old character beh—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:38.52,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,How about you, Hondo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.52,0:03:40.44,Main,Sotomura,0,0,0,,Hey, listen to my answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:41.86,Main,Hondo,0,0,0,,Zero for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:44.15,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,I hope I can get at least one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.15,0:03:46.70,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,You want it from Shinohara, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:48.45,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Wh-Why would you say that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:50.53,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Why would you bring up Shinohara?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.53,0:03:53.70,Main,Hondo,0,0,0,,Well, you're always talking and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:56.12,Main,Hondo,0,0,0,,Shinohara's got a soft \Nspot for you, right, Ike?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:57.83,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,We're not {\i1}always{\i0} talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.83,0:03:59.04,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,I don't like her like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.04,0:04:02.63,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Just admit it, man. You like her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:04.42,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:05.26,Main,Hondo,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:06.93,Main,Hondo,0,0,0,,The girls are just feeling shy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.93,0:04:09.22,Main,Hondo,0,0,0,,so they haven't started handing \Nout their chocolate yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:09.80,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Maybe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.80,0:04:12.31,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,We might still have a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.43,0:04:14.06,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Whoops...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.35,0:04:17.81,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Morning, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.56,0:04:22.44,Main,Hondo,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:25.94,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,I guess they're not just feeling shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:29.49,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,He breaks up with Karuizawa \Nand immediately gets this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.74,0:04:34.66,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:38.00,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,How have things been with Kushida?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:39.08,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:41.84,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Are they going well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.13,0:04:43.34,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.71,0:04:46.80,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm still working hard to \Nimprove our relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:49.34,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Interested in helping?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.97,0:04:51.76,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Just asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.76,0:04:53.01,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:53.97,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:57.98,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Kushida-san has been \Nchanging, little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.39,0:05:01.98,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,She agreed to join me at the \NKeyaki Mall café today after class.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.56,0:05:05.07,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Even though she usually turns \Nme down flat when I ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.57,0:05:06.86,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.57,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I believe we can talk this out rationally.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.57,0:05:11.95,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.95,0:05:13.24,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You sound so detached.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.99,0:05:15.33,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,As if it doesn't concern you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.45,0:05:18.75,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Suzune?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:20.50,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:22.50,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:26.51,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,When can I come by for study help?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.09,0:05:29.63,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You're being unusually assertive today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.63,0:05:31.51,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Well, sure I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.51,0:05:33.39,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,I don't wanna be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.39,0:05:35.64,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,S-So I thought, maybe today—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:36.52,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:39.77,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,We can start after clubs conclude. \NWe'll still have time then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:42.90,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Yeah, figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:58.95,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,According to Karuizawa's report, \NIchinose stayed home again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.51,0:06:11.18,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,I was wondering who that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:14.68,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,The first-years are having a \Nsecret meeting at this hour, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:21.06,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:24.69,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,I'm not without fondness for \Npeople like you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.40,0:06:28.57,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Though my student council \Nwouldn't be the place for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.91,0:06:38.91,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Now, Horikita-senpai, \Nto get down to brass tacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:41.08,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,You want to discuss this \Nin front of the first-year?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:45.46,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,I don't see a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:49.88,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,I want you to sit out the exam tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:52.72,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're aware that I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:56.64,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,You haven't anticipated my next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:57.85,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Rather...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:07:02.48,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,There's not a single student in this school \Nwho can anticipate what I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:06.06,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,That includes your personal favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:08.27,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.27,0:07:11.44,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,You were in the same group as \Nthat first-year, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.15,0:07:14.45,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji Kiyotaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:21.58,Italics,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,The man of whom Horikita \NManabu thinks most highly...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:27.46,Italics,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,And if Ayanokoji was involved \Nin Ryuen's downfall, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:30.96,Italics,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm overthinking it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.67,0:07:33.97,Italics,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,He doesn't look like a man with many layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:43.48,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,It's so cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.93,0:07:47.35,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Why did we have to meet up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:49.36,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,There've gotta be better places!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:54.36,Italics,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Karuizawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:57.45,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,We can't exactly meet up in the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.45,0:08:01.37,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Even if you have broken up with Hirata, \Nit could give rise to unsavory rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.83,0:08:04.04,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You wouldn't want that, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.04,0:08:05.25,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.83,0:08:08.67,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,But doesn't sneaking around \Nmake it seem more fishy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.17,0:08:12.50,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,If anyone spots us, \Nit'll totally lead to rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:14.26,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,No worries there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:18.26,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Sheesh, you're cautious about some \Nthings and not at all about others...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:19.26,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.55,0:08:21.47,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Still, it's freezing out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.47,0:08:23.85,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I wish it could just be summer already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.85,0:08:27.94,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,When summer comes, you'll just say, \N"I wish it could be winter," won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:31.02,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,That's just how girls work, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:33.57,Italics,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,What are they talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.94,0:08:38.45,Italics,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Karuizawa is the one Ayanokoji's \Nsecretly been contacting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.49,0:08:43.66,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,So? Why'd you call me out today specifically?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.91,0:08:46.41,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It could have been any day, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.41,0:08:47.96,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:53.30,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I thought there might be a specific \Nreason you asked to see me today...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.59,0:08:57.80,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,No, there's just something \NI wanted to confirm ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.09,0:09:03.76,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Does this number ring any bells for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.85,0:09:08.89,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Not sure who it could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:13.86,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,They're not on my contact list.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.86,0:09:16.32,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Why don't you just call them back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:19.86,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I've tried several times, \Nbut their phone was turned off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:22.87,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Is it important? Want me to start digging?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:23.99,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.53,0:09:27.00,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's what I wanted to speak to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:29.75,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But don't be careless about it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:31.25,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:34.26,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Is that all you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.63,0:09:35.75,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.30,0:09:38.51,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:41.93,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Are you feeling confident about finals?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:44.01,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I expect them to be rather difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.01,0:09:45.81,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.43,0:09:48.89,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Hey... you mind tutoring me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:52.40,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Maybe not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.94,0:09:56.53,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I can't allow you into our study group.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.11,0:09:59.90,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,We'd need late-night sessions. \NWould that be acceptable?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:02.78,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,It's better than getting expelled!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.78,0:10:03.74,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:06.16,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,We'll set it up, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:08.16,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,See you then!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:10.04,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yeah. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.04,0:10:11.67,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:13.38,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:17.30,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Can I give you a little quiz?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.59,0:10:18.55,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,A quiz?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:21.38,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,What day is today?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:28.31,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The answer seems so obvious, \NI feel like it has to be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:32.64,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Don't overthink it. \NJust give me your first impulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:33.85,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Valenti—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.85,0:10:35.44,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.73,0:10:37.44,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:41.24,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I originally bought it for Yosuke-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:43.82,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,but there's no need for that now, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:46.58,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You prepared it for Hirata, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.87,0:10:48.66,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,What, got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.66,0:10:54.42,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,No, I was just thinking, you must prepare \Nfor Valentine's Day a long time in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:57.09,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I-I like to be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:11:00.09,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I'd made up my mind to break up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.09,0:11:03.59,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,but there was a chance that I \Nmight still need it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:06.09,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Is that how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.30,0:11:10.60,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Well, since you don't have any romantic \Nexperience, I'm sure you wouldn't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:12.56,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.93,0:11:17.90,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Here I thought you'd chosen today \N'cause you wanted me to give you some.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.90,0:11:21.32,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sorry. I wasn't thinking about that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.61,0:11:24.82,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Out of curiosity, did you \Nget any from anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.82,0:11:26.45,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,No, none.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.74,0:11:28.37,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Zero?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.37,0:11:31.20,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Typical. You're a man cut out for zeroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.62,0:11:32.87,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.25,0:11:34.75,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.75,0:11:37.46,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If you give it to me, \Nit won't be zero anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:40.00,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Yeah, which would be \Npretty pathetic in itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:42.84,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Think of me as your emergency backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.13,0:11:47.05,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,And feel free to give me double as thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.05,0:11:49.10,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Is that how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.43,0:11:51.60,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,You bet that's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.14,0:11:54.23,Italics,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Valentine's chocolate, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.81,0:11:59.15,Italics,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,If it's all romance stuff, I guess that's \Nabout as interesting as it'll get.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.94,0:12:00.48,Italics,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,No, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:06.32,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.29,0:12:15.00,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,A-Anyway, I'll head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.25,0:12:19.00,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Hey there, you two.
