Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.22,0:12:31.51,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.84,0:12:32.89,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.89,0:12:34.93,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Hashimoto from Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:37.89,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,We were in the same group \Nat the training camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.35,0:12:40.89,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,A secret meeting in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.89,0:12:43.41,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,You're more than meets the eye, Ayanokoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.11,0:12:46.02,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,There's nothing secret about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.02,0:12:47.69,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,No need to hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.69,0:12:49.53,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Today's Valentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.40,0:12:53.07,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,We weren't meeting up for Valentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.28,0:12:56.66,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,No, no, I can see you've got chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.62,0:13:02.87,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I was on my way to the library \Nwhen Karuizawa called me over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.50,0:13:06.21,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Well, it amounts to the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.67,0:13:08.80,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.13,0:13:11.09,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Do you have some issue with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.09,0:13:13.39,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Well, it's just strange, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.39,0:13:16.35,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Karuizawa's last boyfriend \Nwas Hirata, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:20.43,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Wanting Ayanokoji so bad you'd dump \Na swell guy like Hirata for him...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:23.10,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,That just piques the curiosity, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.48,0:13:25.06,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.06,0:13:27.98,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I think you've got the wrong idea about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:28.98,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Wrong idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.98,0:13:30.03,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.36,0:13:33.32,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I was originally gonna give it to Hirata-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.32,0:13:36.07,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,but throwing it out felt like a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.07,0:13:39.12,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,So I needed a random guy, \Nand I chose Ayanokoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:43.16,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,You two seemed pretty friendly \Nfor him to be a "random guy."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.16,0:13:45.25,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm not buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:49.30,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Huh? You just jump out here \Nand start accusing us...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:51.05,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,What's your problem, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.05,0:13:54.26,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I just want to know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:58.05,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You might as well just be honest with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.39,0:14:02.27,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Trying to hide it like this \Nwill make trouble later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:06.81,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It would be worse if he thought \Nwe were dating, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.98,0:14:12.69,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll tell you, but you'd better \Nnot spread this around, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.69,0:14:13.90,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,My lips are sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:17.82,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I'm just handing it off to Ayanokoji-kun
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.82,0:14:20.79,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,so he can give it to the guy \NI've really got my eye on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.08,0:14:24.21,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,So Ayanokoji is a go-between?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.21,0:14:27.04,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,That's right. Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.04,0:14:29.75,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,So who's the chocolate really for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.75,0:14:33.55,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Huh? You expect me to tell \Nthat to some guy I just met?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.55,0:14:34.55,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Are you some kinda moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.55,0:14:36.09,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:38.01,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Well, fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.01,0:14:40.18,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Seriously, back off already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.93,0:14:44.56,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Yeah, guess I misinterpreted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:48.56,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Here I thought you two had \Na special relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.56,0:14:52.57,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,It's not any of your business, so butt out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:55.70,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.24,0:14:58.95,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,It's not exactly {\i1}not{\i0} my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.95,0:15:00.33,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.37,0:15:04.79,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I've liked you for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.25,0:15:08.33,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,You should go out with me, Karuizawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.96,0:15:13.09,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I dunno who it is you've got your eye on now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.09,0:15:15.55,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,but you haven't told him \Nhow you feel yet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.34,0:15:18.09,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.09,0:15:20.85,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,You really think I'd agree \Nto go out with you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.18,0:15:25.48,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Love is unpredictable. \NThat's what makes it so interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.73,0:15:28.23,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Okay. Well, I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.23,0:15:29.10,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.10,0:15:29.85,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.85,0:15:32.19,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm leaving, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.48,0:15:35.07,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,What a cold fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.07,0:15:36.65,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,What a creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.20,0:15:40.57,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Sorry, Ayanokoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.57,0:15:42.70,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,I came in at an awkward time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:43.99,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm fine with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:47.41,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,There's a lot I wanted to ask you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.41,0:15:49.37,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Can I get your contact info?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.63,0:15:51.63,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:15:57.72,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.47,0:16:01.34,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Well, I should head home for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.97,0:16:04.01,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Later, Ayanokoji!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.35,0:16:05.14,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.44,0:16:15.53,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I certainly wasn't expecting to get five.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.44,0:16:15.90,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1425,0)\fs12\shad0\c&HB9B9BD&\3c&HF4F8FA&\frx354\fry354\frz8.195\pos(349.333,97.333)}Airi
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.44,0:16:15.90,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1425,0)\fs10\shad0\frx354\fry354\pos(456,289)\frz329\3c&HDCE7DD&\c&H8E8C9A&}Haruka
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.82,0:16:20.16,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I guess it's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:42.47,Italics,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.47,0:16:44.01,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It's me, Ichinose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.01,0:16:45.35,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.68,0:16:47.52,Italics,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.93,0:16:49.06,Italics,Ichinose,0,0,0,,What are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.81,0:16:51.27,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That sounds bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.85,0:16:52.69,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You have a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:56.69,Italics,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Yeah. So it's not a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:16:59.99,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I thought maybe you hadn't been eating well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:02.66,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Can you keep rice porridge down?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.11,0:17:04.16,Italics,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.57,0:17:07.12,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'd rather no one see me out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.72,0:17:09.73,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Can you at least accept a check-in visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:12.04,Italics,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Hang on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.25,0:17:18.96,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,You don't take no for an \Nanswer, Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.42,0:17:20.55,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:21.97,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:24.59,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Thanks, I—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:28.47,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.47,0:17:29.47,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:30.77,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.23,0:17:34.48,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Would you like to come inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:41.11,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Feeling better?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:44.24,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.57,0:17:47.91,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But... you really could have just called.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.28,0:17:50.66,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I wanted to talk in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:53.12,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sorry to come so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:55.34,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Have you seen a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.34,0:17:57.84,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Yeah. They said it's a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.84,0:17:59.13,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.42,0:18:03.09,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you wear a mask, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.13,0:18:07.14,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone catching my cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.39,0:18:10.72,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I'm feeling quite a lot better, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.72,0:18:15.85,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I think the oversleeping and under-eating \Nis doing most of the damage at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.19,0:18:20.53,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,And this... rice porridge? Did you make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.53,0:18:21.48,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.82,0:18:23.40,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:25.82,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I can't remember the last time I ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.16,0:18:28.38,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You need to eat proper meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.38,0:18:29.33,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:32.89,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I can't remember the last time \NI saw anyone in person, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.12,0:18:34.58,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.46,0:18:39.71,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,A bunch of my friends came by to \Nsee me, but I turned them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:43.63,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,After that, I think they were \Nconvinced I was depressed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.92,0:18:45.34,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,so they stopped trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.70,0:18:49.99,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Did you want to talk to me in person
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:52.81,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,because you were worried \Nthat I was taking off
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.81,0:18:54.68,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,because of the rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.10,0:18:56.41,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:19:01.27,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I'd never skip school because \Nof some silly rumors, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.94,0:19:03.53,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You're a strong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.19,0:19:06.92,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I'm not sure about "strong"...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.45,0:19:09.50,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,She puts on a strong front,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:14.18,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,but emotional stress can have a \Ndemeritorious effect on the immune system.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.21,0:19:20.54,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Well, you shouldn't stay too long. \NYou'll catch my cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.29,0:19:24.92,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm sorry for keeping you up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.92,0:19:27.93,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Not at all. Thanks for visiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:30.85,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yeah. Don't overdo it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:35.93,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.31,0:19:38.02,Main,Miyamoto,0,0,0,,Hey, are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.89,0:19:38.39,Main_Top,Shinohara,0,0,0,,What in the world?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.39,0:19:40.27,Main_Top,Hondo,0,0,0,,Wh-Who could have done this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.39,0:19:40.27,Main,Miyashita,0,0,0,,You all got it, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.27,0:19:41.02,Main_Top,Ike,0,0,0,,This is nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.40,0:19:42.90,Main,Sotomura,0,0,0,,Is this stuff true?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.90,0:19:44.07,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.78,0:19:46.03,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\b1\fnTimes New Roman\3c&HDEC8C5&\shad0\c&HA48B86&}Let's all have a study meeting to prepare for the test!\N{\c&HD3B9B6&\3c&H181110&}Ayanokoji Kiyotaka has a crush on Karuizawa Kei \N Hondo Ryotaro is only into fat girls
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.07,0:19:46.03,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.03,0:19:47.45,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,This is too damn mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.03,0:19:48.28,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\b1\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&HD3B9B6&\3c&H181110&}Ayanokoji Kiyotaka has a crush on Karuizawa Kei \N Hondo Ryotaro is only into fat girls\NShinohara Satsuki was a prostitute in middle school
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.45,0:19:50.53,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,By the time I got to class, \Nit was already everywhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.28,0:19:50.53,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\b1\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&HD3B9B6&\3c&H181110&}Shinohara Satsuki was a prostitute in middle school\N Sato Maya hates Onodera Kayano
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.53,0:19:52.78,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\b1\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&HD3B9B6&\3c&H181110&}Shinohara Satsuki was a prostitute in middle school\N Sato Maya hates Onodera Kayano
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.31,0:19:56.79,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,They can't do this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:20:00.08,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Hey, Sato, you hate Onodera?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:01.71,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,I-I do not!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:03.67,Main,Matsushita,0,0,0,,This is all made up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.67,0:20:07.97,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I guess I'd better ask Onodera \Nif she knows what it's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.97,0:20:09.30,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.55,0:20:13.10,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,But if it's not true, it's okay to ask, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:14.43,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,That's awful, Yamauchi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.43,0:20:15.06,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.06,0:20:16.72,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Knock it off already, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.72,0:20:19.81,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I just wanna confirm if it's made up or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.48,0:20:21.81,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Hey, Hondo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:24.32,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Is yours true, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.57,0:20:27.07,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.40,0:20:30.41,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,It says you're into Karuizawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.41,0:20:31.36,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.70,0:20:33.99,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Aw, you're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.99,0:20:35.62,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,That's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.41,0:20:40.12,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,The message board is awash with ugly rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.58,0:20:42.13,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,There's one about you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:45.34,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Shi-no-ha-ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.34,0:20:47.17,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,You were a prostitute?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.17,0:20:48.38,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,I was not!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.38,0:20:50.88,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Yamauchi, knock it off already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.88,0:20:52.26,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't hide it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.26,0:20:53.68,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,This is stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:55.89,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,It's just a bunch of made-up rumors!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.89,0:20:58.14,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,Maybe you wrote them yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.14,0:21:00.39,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Huh? It wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.73,0:21:04.02,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,Enough! Just come clean already!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:06.48,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,Who wrote these rumors?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:09.74,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,You know what they say. \N"Where there's smoke, there's fire."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:10.65,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.90,0:21:15.78,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I mean, the real problem is the \Npeople getting written about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.78,0:21:17.20,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Like, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:19.87,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Come clean already.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.12,0:21:21.12,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Yamauchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:22.21,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.54,0:21:24.79,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Yamauchi, you knock it off, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.79,0:21:26.25,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Aw, c'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.25,0:21:29.96,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Shinohara's always so stuck-up. \NThis is our chance to get some payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.96,0:21:31.55,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Payback?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.92,0:21:33.38,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,She said it wasn't true!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.80,0:21:35.39,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,No way to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.39,0:21:39.39,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,It's always the plain girls like her \Nwho've done the nastiest stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.68,0:21:41.14,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,It's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.14,0:21:42.89,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,I didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.89,0:21:44.60,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Knock it off already!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.60,0:21:47.27,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Aw, you're no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.27,0:21:52.80,Main,Miyamoto,0,0,0,,But Sato-san really {\i1}doesn't{\i0} like \NOnodera-san very much, does she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.80,0:21:56.03,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,H-Hey, stop it, Miyamoto-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.03,0:22:00.29,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Yeah, we don't see you two \Nhanging out very often, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:02.79,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,Th-That's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.04,0:22:04.78,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,This is horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.78,0:22:07.54,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,After we'd finally achieved \Nsome measure of class unity...
